# Convex — from https://dashboard.convex.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=dev:your-deployment

# ── Admin signing links (/admin) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# You create the password yourself — there is no built-in key.
#
# 1. Pick a strong password (e.g. MMM-admin-2026!)
# 2. Save it in Convex (dev):
#      npx convex env set ADMIN_SECRET MMM-admin-2026!
# 3. For production deployment, also run:
#      npx convex env set ADMIN_SECRET MMM-admin-2026! --prod
# 4. Open /admin and enter that same password to unlock.